          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of \"acrobatic\" or \"dances\" of multiple glowing orbs in the cloudy sky: likely observations of lasers or \"skytracer\" equipment.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "ee15cd62c7d0d205422f9498791ce1a7a3352be41f89096724f79d3406da7906"
